QR9zXTOVW3oZLuq_3m1kt68ZKKDsjyWhb0uUw8xFhNRQw&oe=6B0DC7C0"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "HotelRnR_CoverLandscape_2560x1440.png", "id": "1079008000317618", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974683_1079008003650951_7654025850976196770_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nQt22zghzGoQ7kNvwFdCtoQ&_nc_oc=AdoNWUItGp0jWJzk9tqXWjqwac_viLGiZ0QKUZYXzJn8hO6ErwMXPwgHyejUYJhlKLQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQT3nqiV5NsaTb6l63WEqJGcBAeh_lytX85eXsaPy-O6CA&oe=6B0DCC05"}, "display_name": "Hotel R'n'R - Rockstar Simulator", "keywords": ["Rockstar", "RnR", "Simulator", "Wizard", "Cat"], "long_description": "\ud83c\udfb8 **Live the rockstar lifestyle** \n\nIn a **sandbox of physics-based demolition**, with time to explore and plan your strategy before lighting the fireworks and doing your best to keep the Hotel Manager out!\n{1979515509218852}\n\n\ud83e\udd4a **40+ Weapons**\n\nPressure from hotel staff and your own limp wrists are against you, but with over 40 weapons and 20+ upgrades, there is a World Tour ahead of you, it\u2019s time to get creative.\n{1101858231351938}\n\n\ud83d\uddfa **6 Luxury hotels to explore**\n\nEach with:\n- Challenges\n- Leaderboards\n- Unique interactions (find the wrecking ball!)\n- Hidden secrets\n\n\n{1137607227798372}\n\n\ud83d\udece  **...AND...**\n- Character Skins\n- Mini-games\n- Sandbox mode\n\n\n\n", "short_description": "Become Infamous for smashing up Hotels! Each hotel is a playground of physics-based demolition, take time to explore, plan and setup before going to work at taking it down! With over 40 weapons - including a bowling ball, C4, guns, glue and a fish - the aim is simple, cause mayhem, how you do it is up to you. Just remember to keep the security out!\n\nThe new \"Magic, Maces and Mange\" free-update adds 5 brand-new weapons, upgrades and 12 new challenges!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "develop